<SceneText>
  <Speakers>
    <Section>Speaker</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46784,46944,47120,47368,47724,47952</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Chester&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Chester&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46868,47032,47260,47500,47644,47864</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>アルベルト</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Albert</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46788</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_040_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>アミィと間違えるなんてな……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I can't believe I
confused her with Ami...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46872</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_040_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>アミィって、おめぇの妹だか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, Ami's your
younger sister, huh?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46948</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_040_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ、ああ、そうだよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, that's right...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47036</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_040_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ほぇ～～～、おめぇに妹がなぁ～～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oooooh~... So ya have
a little sister, huh~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47124</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_040_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>な、なんだよ！　人の顔ジロジロ見て</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wh-What the hell!? What
are you staring for?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47264</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_040_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おめぇみてーなキツネ目の妹っつーことは、
そのアミィっての、名前に合った顔なんだなや</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If she's all fox-eyed like you, I'm
bettin' she ain't much to look at.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47372</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_040_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なんだよ、それ。
アミィが俺に似てるって言いたいのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The hell? So you're trying
to say Ami looks like me?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47504</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_040_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>みなまで言わんでええだ、ええだ。
おめぇの顔見てれば、ぜぇ～んぶわかるだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, I don't need to go off announcin' it to the
world, do I? I can tell, just from lookin' at ya.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47648</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_040_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おめぇはかわいい妹が欲しかったんだ。
だから、さっき&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;をわざと間違えたんだど？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ya always wished your sister were cuter, didn't
ya? And that's why ya confused &lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt; for her?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47728</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_040_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>バカ言ってんじゃねぇっての</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You say a lot of
stupid things, don't you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47868</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_040_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あひゃえ！　当たっただ！　図星だ！！
こいつ、&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;を狙ってる変態だーよ！！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahaha! So I'm right, aren't I!? Bull's-eye!
You're a real pervert, goin' after &lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47956</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_040_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あのなぁ……そりゃ、おまえだろ……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, uhh... Isn't
that *you*?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
